# The VM runs the BACKEND ONLY. Caddy terminates HTTPS for the API subdomain
# and reverse-proxies every request to uvicorn on localhost. Caddy fetches +
# renews the cert automatically once DNS points here and ports 80/443 are open.
#
# The frontend is NOT served here — it's static on GitHub Pages at
# biswas.net/sid/stocktest, and calls this origin cross-origin. CORS is handled
# by FastAPI (app.py: allow_origins=["*"]).

stocktest-api.biswas.net {
	encode zstd gzip
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8000
}
